    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="19" id="PRB-67706F1A2DE9CE60-Q19">
      <question_stem>다음 제어시스템에서 추정오차 $e ( t ) = x ( t ) - \hat{x} ( t )$에 대한 특성방정식의 근이 $- 1$, $- 2$가 되기 위한 이득벡터 $L$의 값은? (단, $A = {\begin{bmatrix}0 &amp; 1 \\ - 1 &amp; 4\end{bmatrix}}$, $B = {\begin{bmatrix}0 \\ 1\end{bmatrix}}$, $C = {\begin{bmatrix}1 &amp; 0\end{bmatrix}}$, $L = {\begin{bmatrix}itl_{1} \\ l_{2}\end{bmatrix}}$이다)</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>e ( t )</keyword>
        <keyword>x ( t )</keyword>
        <keyword>Ax ( t )</keyword>
        <keyword>Bu ( t )</keyword>
        <keyword>y ( t )</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$7$ $29$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 자동제어 · 상태관측기 이득
정답은 ④이다. 오차 동역학은 ė = (A - LC)e이고 특성방정식은 det(sI - A + LC) = s² + (l1 - 4)s + (1 - 4l1 + l2) = 0이다. 원하는 (s + 1)(s + 2) = s² + 3s + 2와 비교하면 l1 - 4 = 3에서 l1 = 7, 1 - 28 + l2 = 2에서 l2 = 29이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$1$ $5$</choice_text>
          <commentary>맞지 않다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$1$ $29$</choice_text>
          <commentary>l1이 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$7$ $5$</choice_text>
          <commentary>l2가 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$7$ $29$</choice_text>
          <commentary>7, 29이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
